    "name": "Defence (Army, Navy, Air Force, Coast Guard)",
    "intro": "Defence jobs have two routes: Agniveer (4-year service for soldiers, sailors and airmen) and officer entries. Caste-based age relaxation generally does not apply. NDA and CDS are covered in Part 4. Army, Navy and Air Force run separate Agniveer recruitments with their own eligibility, exams and physical standards. Under the Agnipath scheme, each Agniveer gets a Seva Nidhi of about ₹10.04 lakh (tax-free) at exit, and up to 25% of a batch can be selected for regular service.",
    "officialWebsite": "https://joinindianarmy.nic.in",
    "status": "published",
    "order": 6,
    "ageRelaxation": {
      "rows": [
        {
          "category": "obc",
          "rule": "No relaxation (except Coast Guard: +3 years)"
        },
        {
