          "category": "pwbdObc",
          "rule": "Not eligible"
        },
        {
          "category": "pwbdScSt",
          "rule": "Not eligible"
        },
        {
          "category": "otherState",
          "rule": "Same rules as other candidates"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "Final-year students can usually apply for graduate exams if they will have the degree by the cut-off date in the notice.",
        "Defence entries generally give no caste-based age relaxation: the same limit applies to every category. The Coast Guard is the exception and follows central relaxation rules.",
        "PwBD candidates are not eligible for any defence entry.",
        "Agniveer age is counted on the cut-off date in each service's notice; some Army specialist trades allow a higher upper age."
      ]
    }
